      "title": "Shyamkamal Investments Limited Announces Appointment of Aesha Harsh Shah As Additional Non-Executive Independent Director And Reconstitution Of Board Committees, Effective February 11, 2026",
      "body": "Shyamkamal Investments Limited announces the appointment of Ms. Aesha Harsh Shah as an Additional Non-Executive and Independent Director of the Company with effect from February 11, 2026. Ms. Aesha Shah is an Associate member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India with a Bachelor’s and Master’s degree in Business Administration, specializing in Finance and Human Resources. She has extensive experience in Corporate Governance, Company Law, and Secretarial functions, handling key legal compliances, listings, and corporate restructuring. Her expertise and leadership make her a valuable Independent Woman Director for any company. The Board also approved the reconstitution of the Audit Committee, Nomination and Remuneration Committee, and Stakeholder Relationship Committee of the Comp",
